This appendix expands the condensed table of open problems presented at the end of the main text into a self‑contained mathematical exposition. For each problem we state the precise mathematical question, summarise the progress achieved in this thesis, and, where possible, provide rigorous partial proofs, reduction steps, or explicit conjectures that clarify the nature of the remaining gap. The numbering corresponds to the six challenges of Chapter 9.

